# Live validation

When asked to run Trustline against real AWS accounts, use `aws-vault exec` with the operator’s named profiles (the ones they last named in chat). Do not store those profile names, account IDs, or leftover in git, PRs, or this rule file.

Bring SecurityAgent to the front if vault hangs on macOS keychain. Write reports under `reports/` (gitignored). Evaluate locally; ship code fixes, not scan artifacts.
